### Steps to reproduce

UDM nudm-sdm service does not support the retrieval  of multiple UE subscription data  in the same time using the dataset-names attribute . 
This option is specified in 3GPP 29.503 5.2.2.2.9 clause Retrieval of Multiple Data Sets . 

For a request, where plmn-id is the Serving Network PLMN ID:
` GET nudm-sdm/v2/imsi-999990000000120?plmn-id=%7B%0A%09%22mcc%22%3A%09%22999%22%2C%0A%09%22mnc%22%3A%09%2242%22%0A%7D&dataset-names=AM%2CSMF_SEL%2CSMS_SUB`

Open5GS UDM responds with a 400 Invalid resource name , as it expects one of the supported resources in the API call (am-data, sm-data, smf-select-data, ue-context-in-smf-data,nssai, smf-selection-subscription-data) . 

I understand that not all specified features can be implemented in Open5GS, but implementing support for dataset-names would make Open5GS UDM better compatible with other 3rd party vendor NFs that implement multiple datasets as the default method for subscriber information retrieval, specially for roaming testing scenarios.  Thank you. 

